# Release signing credentials for Equerry.
#
# Copy this file to `keystore.properties` (which is gitignored) and fill in real values, OR
# provide the same values via environment variables. The Gradle build reads the file first,
# then falls back to the env vars. If neither is present, the release build still assembles —
# just unsigned (F-Droid signs its own builds).
#
# NEVER commit the real keystore.properties or the .jks file (both are gitignored, r-03).
#
# Property            Environment variable
# ------------------  --------------------------
# storeFile           EQUERRY_KEYSTORE_FILE       absolute path to the .jks/.keystore
# storePassword       EQUERRY_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD
# keyAlias            EQUERRY_KEY_ALIAS
# keyPassword         EQUERRY_KEY_PASSWORD

storeFile=/absolute/path/to/equerry-release.jks
storePassword=changeme
keyAlias=equerry
keyPassword=changeme
